sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: A sequence diagram that uses every supported statement
    participant A as Alice
    participant B as Bob
    participant C as Carol
    Note left of A: left of<br>the first
    A->B: solid, no head
    A-->B: dashed, no head
    A-)C: async
    C--)A: async back
    A<<->>B: both ways
    autonumber 10 5
    par to Bob
        A->>B: one
    and to Carol
        A->>C: two
    end
    critical commit
        B->>C: write
    option timeout
        B-->>A: retry
    end
    opt
    end
    break when #quot;quoted#quot;
        C--xC: self, dashed
    end
    autonumber off
    A->>C:
    Note over A,C: over the three of them
    Note right of C: right of<br>the last
